  Reel script says the Rs 20.30 lakh MLA-fund works (cameras, EV charging, women's safety control room, wifi, bus shelters) are at 5 places, but the article says the Rs 20.30 lakh covers those works; the caption also says the Rs 20.30 lakh is for these works, which is consistent, but the reel script omits the Rs 20.30 lakh amount being specifically tied to them — minor; main issue: the slide and caption say the 5 bus shelters/cameras are in 'Sitco Nagar main road, Erukkancherry highway' while the article says Sharma Nagar is among the 5 places, which is not mentioned in the reel script
  Reel script states 'சர்மா நகரில் ரூ.1.31 கோடியில் உடற்பயிற்சிக் கருவிகள்' and 'ரூ.1.42 கோடியில் குத்துச் சண்டை வளையம்' — the article says the Rs 1.31 crore and Rs 1.42 crore works are in Sharma Nagar, which matches; however the reel script omits the Rs 1.42 crore 'பார்வையாளர் மாடம்' detail is present in slides only, not an error
  Slide 'பூங்கா' lists the Rs 1.31 crore and Rs 1.42 crore items under 'பூங்கா' (park) title, but the article says these are in Sharma Nagar, not a park — mislabelled grouping
  Reel script says 'சிட்கோ சாலை' park works are for மாற்றுத்திறனாளிகள் ரப்பர் தளம் - correct; but the reel script attributes the Rs 1.08 crore rubber floor to 'வாசுகி நகர் பூங்கா' while also listing the Sitco road — consistent
  Caption says the MLA-fund works include 'பேருந்து நிழற்குடைகள்' as 5 bus shelters with 'நவீன மின் விளக்குகள்' — consistent with article
